Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:38.63,Hook,,0,0,0,,LE PATEARON EL CARRO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Por qué...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.20,0:00:05.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}...me pateas el carro,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:05.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:07.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿En serio, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:09.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Quieres pelea, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:11.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿A dónde vas, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.90,0:00:12.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Qué vas a hacer?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.68,0:00:14.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿En serio?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.18,0:00:14.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿De verdad?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:16.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Atrás, atrás.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.04,0:00:17.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Uy, tiene una llave\Ninglesa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.40,0:00:18.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Mierda, una...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.90,0:00:21.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}...¡llave!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:24.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Me largo, me largo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:26.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Aquí estoy, carajo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.52,0:00:27.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Dios mío!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.61,0:00:32.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿A que no te esperabas\Nesto, idiota?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.35,0:00:34.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ay, mierda.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.35,0:00:37.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ay, Dios mío, lo siento\Nmucho.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.43,0:00:38.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Miren eso, estoy echando\Ngasolina.
